# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
# .terraform.lock.hcl is committed on purpose (pins provider checksums)

# Plan/apply artifacts
*.tfplan
plan.out

# Lambda module build output (regenerated on every plan/apply from source_path)
terraform/builds/
terraform/bootstrap/*.zip

# Sensitive — never commit
*.pem
*.key

# Claude Code — personal/local overrides (e.g. autoMemoryDirectory). Never committed.
.claude/settings.local.json
